{"id":"25d15dae418e51ef","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-tm-computation.md","title":"Turing Machine Computation","display":"df-tm-computation — Turing Machine Computation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-tm-computation","aliases":["88-df-tm-computation"],"display":"df-tm-computation — Turing Machine Computation","depends_on":["[[88-df-turing-machine]]","[[88-df-tm-configuration]]","[[88-df-tm-step]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-tm-computation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-tm-computation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tm-computation — Turing Machine Computation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fb6aa5db0f2eb060\" href=\"?note=fb6aa5db0f2eb060\" title=\"88-df-tm-configuration\">88-df-tm-configuration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"599db0f23e6c31b5\" href=\"?note=599db0f23e6c31b5\" title=\"88-df-tm-step\">88-df-tm-step</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> (Turing machine, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> (length of the finite run)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conf}_M(C_0),\\ldots,\\mathrm{Conf}_M(C_n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Conf}_M(C_0),\\ldots,\\mathrm{Conf}_M(C_n)\\)</span> (configuration predicates, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fb6aa5db0f2eb060\" href=\"?note=fb6aa5db0f2eb060\" title=\"88-df-tm-configuration\">88-df-tm-configuration</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Step}_M(C_k,C_{k+1})\">\\(\\mathrm{Step}_M(C_k,C_{k+1})\\)</span> (one-step relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"599db0f23e6c31b5\" href=\"?note=599db0f23e6c31b5\" title=\"88-df-tm-step\">88-df-tm-step</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computation}_M(C_0,\\ldots,C_n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Computation}_M(C_0,\\ldots,C_n)\\)</span> (finite-computation predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}computation} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Computation}_M(C_0,\\ldots,C_n)\n\\leftrightarrow\nM\\in\\mathrm{TM}\n\\land n\\in\\mathbb N\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(k\\leq n\\to\\mathrm{Conf}_M(C_k)\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(k&lt;n\\to\\mathrm{Step}_M(C_k,C_{k+1})\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}computation} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Computation}_M(C_0,\\ldots,C_n)\n\\leftrightarrow\nM\\in\\mathrm{TM}\n\\land n\\in\\mathbb N\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(k\\leq n\\to\\mathrm{Conf}_M(C_k)\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(k&lt;n\\to\\mathrm{Step}_M(C_k,C_{k+1})\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>计算是任意有限合法配置序列；是否从初始配置开始或在停机状态结束由下游谓词另行要求</li>\n<li>每步转换遵循状态转换函数</li>\n<li>非停机运行由任意长的有限前缀刻画；本谓词自身只编码有限运行</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-configuration","status":"resolved","id":"fb6aa5db0f2eb060","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-configuration]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-step","status":"resolved","id":"599db0f23e6c31b5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-step]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$ (Turing machine, see [[88-df-turing-machine]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-configuration","status":"resolved","id":"fb6aa5db0f2eb060","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Conf}_M(C_0),\\ldots,\\mathrm{Conf}_M(C_n)$ (configuration predicates, see [[88-df-tm-configuration]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-step","status":"resolved","id":"599db0f23e6c31b5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Step}_M(C_k,C_{k+1})$ (one-step relation, see [[88-df-tm-step]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conf}_M(C_0),\\ldots,\\mathrm{Conf}_M(C_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Step}_M(C_k,C_{k+1})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Computation}_M(C_0,\\ldots,C_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}computation} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Computation}_M(C_0,\\ldots,C_n)\n\\leftrightarrow\nM\\in\\mathrm{TM}\n\\land n\\in\\mathbb N\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(k\\leq n\\to\\mathrm{Conf}_M(C_k)\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(k<n\\to\\mathrm{Step}_M(C_k,C_{k+1})\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1312,"backlinks":[{"id":"5d2dec526682fb65","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Computation}_{M_e^{(k)}}(C_0,\\ldots,C_m)$ (finite computation, see [[88-df-tm-computation]])"},{"id":"6c639e2083bc9b76","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Computation}_M(C_0,\\ldots,C_n)$ (finite computation, see [[88-df-tm-computation]])"},{"id":"a93cc0702f1280f5","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Computation}_M(c_0,\\ldots,c_n)$ (finite computation, see [[88-df-tm-computation]])"},{"id":"fff1247dc8d93b4d","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Computation}_M(c_0,\\ldots,c_n)$ (finite computation, see [[88-df-tm-computation]])"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-141","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-ackermann-function.md]]\n[[88-df-alphabet.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-delta.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-pi.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-sigma.md]]\n[[88-df-assignment.md]]\n[[88-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-axiom.md]]\n[[88-df-bijective.md]]\n[[88-df-bound-variable.md]]\n[[88-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[88-df-canonical-model.md]]\n[[88-df-cardinality.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-indexing.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[88-df-church-turing-thesis.md]]\n[[88-df-classical-calculus.md]]\n[[88-df-closed-term.md]]\n[[88-df-compactness.md]]\n[[88-df-completeness.md]]\n[[88-df-computable-function.md]]\n[[88-df-consistent.md]]\n[[88-df-countable.md]]\n[[88-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[88-df-decidable-set.md]]\n[[88-df-defined.md]]\n[[88-df-delta0-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-delta1-set.md]]\n[[88-df-derivation.md]]\n[[88-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[88-df-effective-join.md]]\n[[88-df-effe